  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">COVID-19 C.A.R.E.S Component 3 - Health and Business Support Program</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IPRT will address the COVID-19 impact/emergency in local communities in Somalia by implementing health related programs tailored specifically for healthcare workers. IPRT will set up a business innovation center that support enterprises affected by the pandemic. IPRT will host the training and place trainees in Hargeisa and Burao.</narrative>
  </description>
